  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XLhWGhC.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/different-textures-for-enchanted-books\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/452537?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdifferent-textures-for-enchanted-books\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/different-textures-for-enchanted-books?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>這個資源包為每本附魔書賦予獨特的紋理，讓您一眼就能輕鬆找到所需的附魔書。每本書的封面顏色根據附魔類型和可應用的物品進行主題設計，幫助您在物品欄或儲物箱中快速整理和識別。</p><ul>\n<li><strong>自 1.21.5 起</strong> 您不需要任何額外的模組</li>\n<li><strong>從 1.20.5 到 1.21.3</strong> 建議使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-enchanted-books-hotfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT：附魔書熱修復</a></li>\n<li><strong>從 1.13 到 1.20.4</strong> 您應使用任何支援 CIT 標準的模組，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT Resewn</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a></li>\n<li>您也可以將其作為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/different-textures-for-enchanted-books\" rel=\"nofollow\">獨立模組</a> 運行</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">新紋理範例</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">資源包 <strong>開啟</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ClzoG9Q.png\" width=\"460\" height=\"563\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gF6wPij.png\" width=\"460\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">資源包 <strong>關閉</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/buQW2Sc.png\" width=\"460\" height=\"572\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qg9kIju.png\" width=\"460\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
